// Secrets.example.xcconfig — TEMPLATE, safe to commit.
//
// This file documents every build setting the app expects to be injected
// at build time instead of hardcoded in source. To build the app:
//   1. Copy this file to Secrets.xcconfig (same folder).
//   2. Fill in real values below.
//   3. Run `xcodegen generate` to regenerate the .xcodeproj.
// Secrets.xcconfig is gitignored, so your real values never get committed.

// InnerTube WEB_REMIX client API key, used for all YouTube Music InnerTube
// API requests (search, browse, player, etc.).
//
// NOTE: this is NOT a private/billed credential tied to any individual
// Google account — it's the same public "InnerTube WEB client" key that
// YouTube embeds client-side in every youtube.com page's own JavaScript,
// and that virtually every open-source YouTube/YouTube-Music client
// (yt-dlp, ytmusicapi, Metrolist, etc.) uses identically. It's a client-type
// identifier, not a secret. It's still kept out of source and injected via
// this xcconfig so the codebase defaults to "nothing key-shaped is
// hardcoded," consistent with how any other credential in this project
// would be handled.
//
// The real, working value is the well-known public InnerTube WEB_REMIX key:
// AIzaSyC9XL3ZjWddXya6X74dJoCTL-WEYFDNX30
// (Same value YouTube Music's own web client ships — see comment above.)
INNERTUBE_API_KEY = YOUR_INNERTUBE_API_KEY_HERE
